270	    /**
271	     * Normalizes an optional owner email. An email is optional, so a {@code null} value is
272	     * accepted and returned unchanged. When present it must be a syntactically valid address;
273	     * the value is stored and returned lower-cased. When present but invalid an
274	     * {@link InvalidFieldsException} is thrown, which the exception advice renders as a 400
275	     * response naming the {@code email} field.
